k about if he ever thought about how Mafuyu felt...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y2kLLF5g3Mlbf1fyyXduGEQNwTy.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"Ritsuka is floored after hearing Mafuyu’s singing voice and invites him into the band, but Mafuyu declines. Ritsuka just can’t take no for an answer and keeps trying to invite Mafuyu into the band, but now, Mafuyu is avoiding him. Then during band practice, Haruki asks Ritsuka to actually think about if he ever thought about how Mafuyu felt...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y2kLLF5g3Mlbf1fyyXduGEQNwTy.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"14756","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"108430","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"39533","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"88040","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"361218","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"23679","synopsis":"Mafuyu finally decides to join the band. In order to compose a song to go along with the little tidbit that Mafuyu sang for him, Ritsuka dives back into playing guitar nonstop. Haruki is at his part-time job one day when his friend Koji Yatake comes by and asks him if he and his band would like to appear in a live show he’s putting on. Ritsuka is teaching Mafuyu guitar at school as usual and then invites Mafuyu to go look at effect pedals with him.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3ftQtD97a7AqgiDcgKxMileKbW1.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"Mafuyu finally decides to join the band. In order to compose a song to go along with the little tidbit that Mafuyu sang for him, Ritsuka dives back into playing guitar nonstop. Haruki is at his part-time job one day when his friend Koji Yatake comes by and asks him if he and his band would like to appear in a live show he’s putting on. Ritsuka is teaching Mafuyu guitar at school as usual and then invites Mafuyu to go look at effect pedals with him.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3ftQtD97a7AqgiDcgKxMileKbW1.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"14756","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"108430","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"39533","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"88040","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"361218","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"24415","synopsis":"It is decided that Ritsuka and the rest of his band are doing a live show. Haruki and Akihiko go out drinking and talk about Ritsuka and Mafuyu. Since Akihiko had ridden his motorcycle into town, he asks to spend the night at Haruki’s place and Haruki thinks back on the first time they met. That was right around the time Haruki’s old band had disbanded and he had first encountered Ritsuka, who had just entered his third year of middle school...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/A06uyPV6xbKJtr97i01cFo1X8hr.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"It is decided that Ritsuka and the rest of his band are doing a live show. Haruki and Akihiko go out drinking and talk about Ritsuka and Mafuyu. Since Akihiko had ridden his motorcycle into town, he asks to spend the night at Haruki’s place and Haruki thinks back on the first time they met. That was right around the time Haruki’s old band had disbanded and he had first encountered Ritsuka, who had just entered his third year of middle school...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/A06uyPV6xbKJtr97i01cFo1X8hr.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"